 "summary": "No duplication of Mathlib, TauCeti, Physlib or EpsilonEridani material: charFun needs `[Inner \u211d E]` and TauCeti's pontryaginMeasureTransform lives on the dual, so `anisotropyCoeff` is new; Mathlib's `fourier_add`/`fourier_norm` are index-additivity and sup-norm, not the argument-level facts added here; no upstream lemma covers the double-erase constant sum. Proofs reuse `Integrable.of_bound`, `IndepFun.integral_fun_comp_mul_comp`, `HasLaw.integral_comp`, `iIndepFun_pi` and `integral_withDensity_eq_integral_toReal_smul\u2080` instead of re-deriving them.",
